@astermesh/pglite-react is a modified distribution of PGlite React by
Electric DB Limited:

https://github.com/electric-sql/pglite

The AsterMesh distribution uses its own package identity and depends on the
corresponding @astermesh/pglite package. Exact upstream and AsterMesh source
revisions for each release are recorded in the signed fork-lineage
attestation associated with the package tarball:

https://github.com/astermesh/pglite

